+The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each holds, listed a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty is shown as having none rather than left blank. A reader can narrow the directory to the veterinarians holding one named Specialty by stating that Specialty in the page address. Paging then runs over the narrowed list, and the links between pages keep the narrowing `[REQ-VET-001]`.
+
+The same list is published in a machine-readable form for other programs to read. It returns every veterinarian with their specialties at once, not a page at a time, and narrows by a named Specialty in the same way `[REQ-VET-003]`.
