+On both, the Specialty name must match whole, disregarding letter case, so part of a name matches nothing. A name no veterinarian holds yields an empty list, not an error. A blank name is ignored, as in owner search. Neither offers a control for choosing the Specialty; the narrowing lives only in the address.
 
