+## Scale and Load
+
+This section records, for each path whose cost grows with stored data, its realistic size, access pattern, and chosen form. Implementers select a form against these rows, and reviewers judge against them. Both veterinarian reads are bounded and run one database query per request. Unfiltered reads come from the `vets` cache; Specialty-filtered reads are not cached. Only the veterinarian paths have rows; other paths gain a row when a slice touches them.
