+| Machine-readable veterinarian list, whole, optionally narrowed to one Specialty | Same as the directory; unrecorded, treated as bounded | Unrecorded | Shared read-mostly | One unpaged query returning every matching veterinarian, serialized whole. Unfiltered list from the `vets` cache; filtered list not cached |
